WEBVTT

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:06.410
About five hours left until the 
Tower of Hanoi is finished.

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:07.320
Yeah.

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:10.890
Revolver finally made his move.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:16.960
If you want to stop this 
game, you must defeat me.

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:20.150
He has the lead in this game.

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:24.040
A game that'll destroy the entire network...

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.040
That's not a fun game!

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:30.000
I will defeat Revolver and end this game.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.760
Nice!  That's why you're Playmaker!

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:52.740
I run Across the universe

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:55.910
At the speed of light

00:00:56.310 --> 00:00:57.780
Begin Loading

00:00:58.020 --> 00:01:01.520
Open the door of dreams

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:05.090
VRAINS spreads

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:08.190
Believe in myself

00:01:08.430 --> 00:01:11.730
VRAINS continues

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:17.040
The circuit draws the future

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:21.110
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:01:21.470 --> 00:01:22.710
Access!

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:25.410
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:27.010
I'm now With the Wind

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:29.310
Link with my soul

00:01:29.410 --> 00:01:32.080
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:33.820
Now Win the Race

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:36.660
Connected world

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:40.160
No matter when

00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:43.530
Nothing is impossible

00:01:43.730 --> 00:01:47.670
Strive for hope

00:01:47.860 --> 00:01:52.250
And ride the wind!

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:20.590
That's right!  With this...

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:23.960
My turn!  I draw!

00:02:24.590 --> 00:02:28.590
I summon Trickstar Candina from my hand!

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:36.480
When Candina is summoned, I can add 
a Trickstar in my deck to my hand!

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:39.610
Come out, the circuit of dreams and hope!

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:43.060
The summoning conditions are two Trickstars.

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:47.080
I set Trickstar Lycoris and Candina!

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:53.140
Appear, Link 2 Trickstar Crimson Heart!

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:04.330
Since I Link Summoned, the Field Spell 
Trickstar Light Arena's effect activates!

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:08.300
I Special Summon a Trickstar 
that was used to Link Summon!

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:10.760
Return, Candina!

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:20.210
When a Trickstar is Special Summoned next 
to Crimson Heart's link, I regain 200 LP!

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:25.640
I discard a Trickstar from my hand 
to activate Crimson Heart's effect!

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:28.920
We both draw one card from our decks.

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:31.940
Answer me, my deck!

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:33.590
Good!

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:34.940
Here I go!

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:38.480
I activate the spell card, Trickstar Bouquet!

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:46.800
By returning Candina to my hand, 
a monster gains ATK equal to hers!

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:51.980
I raise the ATK of... Sunavalon Dryades!

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:55.520
My monster?

00:03:55.520 --> 00:04:00.250
I activate the Quick-Play 
Spell, Trickstar Temptation!

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:03.880
Since your monster's ATK changed, 
it returns to your hand.

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:06.360
Ah.  I didn't expect that move.

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:10.260
Blue Angel was on the ropes, 
but she's gaining momentum!

00:04:10.260 --> 00:04:15.340
Yeah!  Keep it up and wipe that 
spooky grin off of Spectre's face!

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:18.340
Please win.

00:04:18.340 --> 00:04:19.820
Chief Zaizen...

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:21.640
Aoi...

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:27.240
I sense that you have 
strong love for Sunavalon.

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:30.220
But also strong hatred.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:32.450
Hatred?

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:36.520
Unsatisfying love leads to greater hatred.

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:41.420
But Sunavalon wraps you in kindness.

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:43.440
Interesting.

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:47.420
It's true that when I was 
young, I sought love.

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:51.420
But no matter how much I 
sought, it went unfulfilled.

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:54.900
And that created a deep scar in your heart.

00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:57.910
Yes.  But I'm fine now.

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:02.980
The blue angel fights for 
those who are deeply hurt.

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:08.120
Will you fight for me too?

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:11.580
Return Dryades to his hand!

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:17.620
Sunavalon can't be attacked, 
but you found its weakness.

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:20.620
Please keep fighting for me!

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:25.260
I activate Sunvine Maiden's 
effect from my hand!

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:30.620
By Special Summoning this card, 
Temptation's effect is negated.

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:38.140
I couldn't get rid of Sunavalon.

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:42.840
Because your desire to understand 
me isn't strong enough.

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:46.090
Please try harder to understand me!

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:51.140
I set one card and end my turn.

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:56.850
Trickstar Bouquet's effect ends, 
so Dryades's ATK returns to 0.

00:05:57.600 --> 00:06:01.420
You still don't understand how lonely I was.

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:09.650
Alone at the bottom of a canyon, 
alone with no sound nor light.

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:13.200
Alone, wandering forever.

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:16.090
Please try harder to understand.

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:19.440
If not, you can't defeat me.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:22.770
My turn.  I draw.

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:27.920
Appear!  The future circuit 
that lights up our path!

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:31.650
The summoning conditions are 
at least two Plant monsters.

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:38.760
I set Sunvine Maiden and Link 2 
Sunavalon Dryades in the Link Markers!

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:41.850
Link Summon!

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:46.920
Appear, Link 3 Sunavalon Dryanome!

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:58.630
Sunavalon grew even more!

00:06:58.840 --> 00:07:04.640
I discard a card to activate the 
Continuous Spell, Sunvine Shrine.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:08.310
Once per turn, I Special Summon a Level 4 or

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:11.580
lower Plant-Type Normal 
Monster from my graveyard.

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:15.570
Resurrect, Sunseed Genius Loci!

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:20.050
My preparations are complete.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:25.260
Appear again!  The future circuit 
that lights up our path!

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:29.570
The summoning condition is one 
Plant-Type Normal Monster.

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:32.100
I set Genius Loci!

00:07:32.820 --> 00:07:34.370
Link Summon!

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:38.340
Appear, Link 1 Sunvine Thrasher!

00:07:41.530 --> 00:07:43.390
By linking to Sunavalon,

00:07:43.390 --> 00:07:48.980
Thrasher gains 800 ATK for every 
one of Sunavalon's Link Markers.

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:54.730
Dryanome is Link 3, so it gains 2400 ATK!

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:58.460
3200 ATK!

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:05.210
Remember that Thrasher's effect lets me 
steal the monster it destroys in battle.

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:07.270
Let's battle!

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:10.570
Thrasher attacks Crimson Heart!

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:18.670
Light Arena's effect!

00:08:18.670 --> 00:08:22.150
Battle damage involving a Trickstar 
Link Monster becomes 0 once,

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:26.550
and I gain LP equal to that amount!

00:08:26.920 --> 00:08:31.980
You didn't take damage, but 
I'm taking your Trickstar.

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:33.750
Thrasher's effect!

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:38.160
The Crimson Heart it destroyed in battle is 
Special Summoned next to Sunavalon's link!

00:08:51.980 --> 00:08:54.680
Now your field is empty.

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:57.980
Your teammate's attack awaits!

00:08:57.980 --> 00:09:00.460
Holly Angel attacks you directly!

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:10.560
The battle isn't over yet.

00:09:11.140 --> 00:09:13.470
Crimson Heart!  Go!

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:20.640
I end my turn.

00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:24.400
Even if I attack, as long 
as he has Sunavalon...

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:28.080
...he'll Special Summon a 
Sunvine to stop the damage.

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:31.080
That means now's my only chance!

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:33.990
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:38.880
I summon Trickstar Nightshade!

00:09:42.300 --> 00:09:45.270
Come out, the circuit of dreams and hope!

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:51.470
The summoning condition is one 
Level 2 or lower Trickstar.

00:09:51.470 --> 00:09:54.110
I set Trickstar Nightshade!

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:56.270
Link Summon!

00:09:56.270 --> 00:10:00.490
Appear, Link 1 Trickstar Bloom!

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:07.920
When Bloom is Link Summoned, 
you draw one card!

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:11.410
You're gifting me a draw?

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:13.930
How generous.

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:16.000
You'll find out why soon.

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:19.160
I activate Nightshade's effect 
who I used to Link Summon!

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:21.630
I Special Summon her from my graveyard!

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:24.240
I Link Summon again!

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:27.240
The summoning conditions are two Trickstars!

00:10:27.240 --> 00:10:30.610
I set Trickstar Nightshade and Bloom!

00:10:31.910 --> 00:10:36.920
Appear, Link 2 Trickstar Black Catbat!

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:41.660
Due to Light Arena's effect,

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:44.790
I Special Summon Nightshade 
that was used to Link Summon!

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:50.530
Shine again, the circuit of dreams and hope!

00:10:50.860 --> 00:10:54.300
The summoning conditions are 
at least two Trickstars!

00:10:54.500 --> 00:11:00.290
I set Trickstar Nightshade and Link 
2 Black Catbat in the Link Markers!

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:08.340
Appear, Link 3 Trickstar Delfiendium!

00:11:12.550 --> 00:11:14.520
A new Trickstar?

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:18.500
I activate the trap, Trickstar Maribold!

00:11:18.760 --> 00:11:23.460
By returning a Trickstar in my graveyard 
to my hand, I'm allowed to summon again.

00:11:23.470 --> 00:11:28.260
I return Lycoris to my 
hand and summon Candina!

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:33.870
Candina's effect adds a Lycoris 
from my deck to my hand.

00:11:34.140 --> 00:11:36.340
I set one card.

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:37.580
Let's battle!

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:40.550
Delfiendium attacks Crimson Heart!

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:44.750
Delfiendium's effect activates!

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:49.720
For every Link Monster you have, I 
can add a banished card to my hand!

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:50.990
What?

00:11:50.990 --> 00:11:53.450
There are four Link Monsters on your field.

00:11:53.450 --> 00:11:55.730
There are three banished cards!

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:58.140
Banished cards...  Can it be?

00:11:58.140 --> 00:11:59.700
It can!

00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:04.450
I add three Trickstar 
Reincarnations to my hand!

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:11.380
And for every card that was added 
to my hand, she gains 1000 ATK!

00:12:11.610 --> 00:12:14.760
She now has 5200 ATK!

00:12:16.690 --> 00:12:21.230
But Dryanome completely protects me.

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:25.050
It's true that your Sunavalon 
is a troublesome monster...

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:29.670
...because it stops damage by Special 
Summoning a Sunvine next to its link.

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:33.870
But since its links are all 
full, you can't use that effect!

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:36.100
Well done.

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:39.340
You were waiting for the moment 
when its links were full.

00:12:39.990 --> 00:12:44.310
I can erase all of Spectre's 
LP with a single attack.

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:46.840
Go, Delfiendium!

00:12:50.880 --> 00:12:51.930
I win.

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:58.930
Wonderful.  That was an impressive strategy.

00:13:00.180 --> 00:13:01.610
Why?

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:10.060
Why is Spectre okay?

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:12.750
I don't know.

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:15.970
I thought the attack went through, but...

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:18.440
What's going on?

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:24.020
I activated Dryanome's effect.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:28.350
When a monster next to 
its link is attacked...

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:33.280
...I can change that monster's 
location to negate the attack.

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:39.530
Your attack was no threat at all.

00:13:40.680 --> 00:13:42.770
I end my turn.

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:46.250
Delfiendium's ATK returns to normal.

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:51.220
I send Shrine to the graveyard at the 
end of the turn to activate its effect.

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:53.910
I set a trap card from my graveyard.

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:59.180
Shouldn't you have set the Reincarnations 
that you added to your hand?

00:14:00.070 --> 00:14:05.170
If I use Delfiendium's effect, I can't set 
cards that were added to my hand that turn.

00:14:05.380 --> 00:14:08.160
So there's nothing you can do.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:10.420
Then I'll end you.

00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:12.540
My turn.  I draw.

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:18.740
I'll let you meet Ghost Girl soon enough.

00:14:19.740 --> 00:14:22.020
I won't give up!

00:14:22.020 --> 00:14:27.980
I activate the effects of the two Lycoris 
in my hand on Candina and Delfiendium!

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:32.490
I Special Summon two Lycoris 
in defense position!

00:14:32.490 --> 00:14:37.700
And I return Candina to my hand 
and Delfiendium to my Extra Deck!

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:41.730
I see.  You strengthened your defenses.

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:44.820
Good.  Please don't give up.

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:46.440
Save me!

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:49.220
I'm going for it using this card!

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:52.620
I activate the Continuous 
Trap, Trickstar Treat!

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:56.520
When this card activates, I 
place one Trickstar Counter.

00:14:57.190 --> 00:15:02.510
At the end of our turns, when this card 
has at least two Trickstar Counters...

00:15:02.510 --> 00:15:07.900
...this card is destroyed, and 
I take 1000 damage per Counter.

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:14.190
And I need to put a Trickstar 
Counter on this card to use it.

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:20.500
Due to its effect, I can set a 
Trickstar trap card from my hand!

00:15:20.880 --> 00:15:23.850
I set Reincarnation!

00:15:24.280 --> 00:15:30.220
That card banishes all cards in my hand, 
and then I draw the same number of cards.

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:34.950
By comboing it with Lycoris, 
it'll deal big damage.

00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:40.420
But it's too late to set a trap.

00:15:40.420 --> 00:15:43.240
No, I'll end you right now!

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:47.300
The trap I just set can 
be activated this turn!

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:50.740
No way!  This is what you were aiming for?

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:55.700
When you analyze, you focus on protection.

00:15:56.060 --> 00:15:57.710
So what?

00:15:57.710 --> 00:16:02.580
It means you secretly desire 
to be protected too.

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:06.440
That's what your deck tells me.

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:09.050
You're the same as me.

00:16:10.480 --> 00:16:13.850
When you were alone, you sought love.

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:18.170
And Blue Angel's blue is the ultimate love.

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:21.300
You're seeking blue love.

00:16:21.490 --> 00:16:23.100
Blue love?

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:27.300
Blue Angel will descend into your heart!

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:30.240
And save your soul!

00:16:30.680 --> 00:16:32.190
Really?

00:16:32.870 --> 00:16:35.710
Please save my soul!

00:16:36.030 --> 00:16:38.710
First, I activate Reincarnation!

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:44.680
You banish all cards in your hand, and 
then draw a card for each banished card.

00:16:45.070 --> 00:16:47.180
Next, Lycoris's effect!

00:16:47.180 --> 00:16:51.160
You take 200 damage for every card you drew!

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:53.420
You drew four cards!

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:55.630
There are two Lycoris on my field!

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:58.360
You take 1600 damage!

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:03.840
But that's not enough.

00:17:03.840 --> 00:17:07.060
I activate Dryanome's effect!

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:10.510
I Special Summon a Sunvine 
from my Extra Deck...

00:17:10.510 --> 00:17:14.990
...and regain LP equal to the damage 
I took from one of your Lycoris!

00:17:14.990 --> 00:17:19.570
Appear, Link 1 Sunvine Healer!

00:17:23.570 --> 00:17:25.950
Since it's linked to Sunavalon,

00:17:25.950 --> 00:17:31.500
Healer's effect restores 300 LP for 
each of Sunavalon's Link Markers.

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:37.650
Dryanome is Link 3, so I gain 900 LP.

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:40.880
No matter how much you gain, it's too late.

00:17:41.470 --> 00:17:48.000
I place one counter on Trickstar Treat to 
set a second Reincarnation and activate it!

00:17:48.910 --> 00:17:50.980
My LP...

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:54.920
Two Lycoris' effects!

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:56.950
You take 1600 damage!

00:18:01.250 --> 00:18:05.020
In the Blue Angel book, the lonely 
angel who doesn't know love...

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:13.140
...learns that even the cruelest evil 
has deep, blue love in their hearts.

00:18:13.430 --> 00:18:19.600
Maybe I've been yearning for that blue love.

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:21.610
Maddeningly so!

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:25.460
Take Blue Angel's blue love!

00:18:25.760 --> 00:18:33.000
I place a counter on Trickstar Treat to set 
the final Reincarnation and activate it!

00:18:33.560 --> 00:18:38.430
You banish all cards in your hand, and then 
draw a card from your deck for each one.

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:42.530
The two Lycoris' effects 
deal you 1600 damage!

00:18:42.530 --> 00:18:44.770
Your LP will drop to 0!

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:51.450
Thanks to you, I'll finally know blue love!

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:54.980
My soul will be saved.

00:18:56.840 --> 00:18:57.980
Huh?

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:04.190
When the door to my heart opened, 
there was still one card left.

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:08.640
I activate the trap, Sunbloom Doom!

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:11.630
I select a monster on the field.

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:14.510
I regain LP equal to the total 
ATK of monsters that have

00:19:14.510 --> 00:19:17.840
the same Type as the monster I chose!

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:21.360
I choose...

00:19:22.480 --> 00:19:25.080
The Fairy-Type Holly Angel!

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:31.080
Therefore, I regain LP equal 
to the Trickstars' total ATK!

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:34.290
8800?

00:19:34.580 --> 00:19:38.960
Are you unable to erase all my LP?

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:43.900
Oh no...  That's not what you promised.

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:48.700
Aren't you supposed to save my soul?

00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:51.400
You disappoint me.

00:19:51.400 --> 00:19:56.870
This means you failed to become the 
Blue Angel from the picture book.

00:19:57.630 --> 00:20:02.620
Due to the two Lycoris' 
effects, I take 1600 damage.

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:08.450
When I was a child, I also 
read this picture book.

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:12.680
By the way, I just cried blue tears.

00:20:12.680 --> 00:20:18.400
Since you're Blue Angel, you must know why.

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:20.960
Too bad.

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:23.200
The evil that I must defeat -

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:28.640
someone pathetically deluded to 
think she can save me - is you!

00:20:28.780 --> 00:20:32.080
Pathetic.  So pathetic!

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:43.470
Does playing with my heart make you happy?

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:49.760
Even if I don't do anything, Trickstar 
Treat's effect will destroy you.

00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:52.960
But I'm going to end you now.

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:57.230
I banish Sunbloom Doom from my 
graveyard to activate its effect.

00:20:57.230 --> 00:21:00.180
All monsters with Levels 
equal or less than...

00:21:00.180 --> 00:21:03.080
...the number of spells and traps 
that activated and went to the

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:04.710
graveyard this turn are destroyed.

00:21:04.800 --> 00:21:08.220
Three cards activated and went 
to the graveyard this turn.

00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:12.120
The two Level 3 or lower 
Lycoris are destroyed!

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:17.760
And you take 500 damage for 
each destroyed monster!

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:26.060
Goodbye, Aoi Zaizen.  The pathetic 
girl who couldn't become a blue angel.

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:32.280
I now break Blue Angel's wings 
to take everything from her!

00:21:44.140 --> 00:21:46.070
Hey, what's that?

00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:50.800
That's...

00:21:50.800 --> 00:21:52.260
Aoi!

00:22:08.820 --> 00:22:15.640
My life is like detestably bad graffiti

00:22:16.030 --> 00:22:22.780
But when you looked at 
me, I felt I wasn't alone

00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:30.010
I'm glad that I'm alive  I truly am

00:22:30.510 --> 00:22:37.360
What I couldn't say before, I can say now

00:22:38.210 --> 00:22:44.600
Within the sadness that I kept holding down

00:22:44.980 --> 00:22:48.750
There were fragments of power

00:22:48.980 --> 00:22:55.930
No one can take away my light to the future

00:22:56.160 --> 00:23:03.270
The chronicles of life only has a few lines

00:23:03.400 --> 00:23:10.450
People I meet, my regrets – they're 
all like ultramarine diamonds to me

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:17.680
You've always confront loneliness by yourself

00:23:17.810 --> 00:23:24.560
I bet we can now laugh 
together, forever and ever

00:23:25.250 --> 00:23:32.230
Lighting Life with our invisible bond

00:23:36.790 --> 00:23:41.460
His hellish past makes him yearn for revenge.

00:23:41.460 --> 00:23:45.960
The only ones worth hating 
are the Knights of Hanoi.

00:23:45.960 --> 00:23:50.650
But his unwavering conviction 
begins to waver.

00:23:50.650 --> 00:23:55.810
After ten years, the two men of destiny meet.

00:23:55.810 --> 00:23:58.820
Why are you helping Revolver?

00:23:58.820 --> 00:24:03.040
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
The Other Lost Incident

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:05.150
Into the VRAINS!
